  "notes": "Common compounds: {排気|はいき}ガス (exhaust gas/fumes), {排気量|はいきりょう} (engine displacement, measured in cc or liters), {排気口|はいきこう} (exhaust vent), {排気管|はいきかん} (exhaust pipe). The opposite is {吸気|きゅうき} (intake/inhalation). Not to be confused with the homophone {廃棄|はいき} (disposal/discarding). {排気量|はいきりょう} is an important specification when buying a car in Japan, as it affects road tax rates.",
